    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "## Purpose\n\nMake DUNCAN PRIME the single primordial/master identity root for ZORR, define SALVADOR as an internal specialist facet, make stylish-anime mastery the primary Night School objective, and grow DUNCAN's SELF_MODEL from evidence-backed OWNER tastes.\n\n## OWNER-directed hierarchy\n\n`DUNCAN PRIME = PRIMORDIAL MASTER AGENT`\n\n`SALVADOR = INTERNAL DUNCAN PRIME SPECIALIST FACET`\n\n`ANIME STYLE MASTERY > SUPPORTING ART/SCIENCE > TOOLING`\n\n`OWNER_SIGNAL -> PROVENANCE -> REPEAT/CONFIRM -> APPLY ON NEW CASE -> OWNER/QC OUTCOME -> SELF_MODEL/TASTE_MODEL DELTA -> DURABLE RECORD`\n\nHard implementation law: `EXISTING ZORR CODE -> NATIVE/STANDARD PLATFORM -> MATURE OPEN-SOURCE SOURCE CODE -> MINIMAL ZORR GLUE`.\n\nPrimary anime anchors: JoJo's Bizarre Adventure, Bleach. Cross-art atlas: Salvador Dalí, David Lynch, Giorgio de Chirico, Max Ernst, Katsushika Hokusai, extensible by lesson relevance.\n\nStudy extracts transferable principles; it does not clone copyrighted frames, character designs, or exact living-artist styles.\n\n## Open-code substrate\n\nPrefer inspected upstream code/APIs/tests: Letta/Letta Code/MemFS, Krita, OpenToonz, Natron, G'MIC, OpenImageIO, OpenColorIO, OpenTimelineIO, PySceneDetect, OpenCV, SymPy/SciPy, Lean/mathlib, Open3D, and better mature OSS when fresh evidence supports it. No custom replacement while a suitable mature open implementation exists.\n\n## Scope\n\nDocs/bootstrap only:\n- `AGENTS.md`\n- design spec\n- implementation plan\n\nNo production code, workflow, canon, runtime, model-weight, merge-authority or QC-authority change.\n\n## Verification gate\n\nRequire exact changed-file scope, fresh read-back, existing Night School prompt alignment, issue #206 contract alignment, Permanent Archive evidence, and Constitution re-read before PASS.",
